Title: River Years
Credit: Sample script for age-based casting roles
Author: Screenplay Breakdown test suite

EXT. RIVERBANK VILLAGE - DAY #1#

Monsoon clouds over a mud-walled village. ARJUN (6), barefoot, chases a paper boat along the bank. His mother MAA (35) watches from the steps, a brass pot on her hip.

She looks at her reflection in A MIRROR propped against the wall. A KNIFE lies beside a half-cut mango.

ARJUN
Maa, it's winning!

MAA
Don't go too far, beta.

INT. MUD HOUSE - NIGHT #2#

A kerosene lamp. Arjun sleeps curled against Maa. THE THUNDER rolls overhead.

MAA
(whispering)
Sleep. The river will still be there tomorrow.

EXT. VILLAGE SCHOOL - DAY #3#

TWO JEEPS rumble past the school gate. Arjun, satchel bouncing, runs after them. A WARD BOY from the clinic shouts after him. THREE VILLAGERS laugh.

ARJUN
Wait for me!

EXT. CITY SKYLINE - DAY #4#

SUPER: TWENTY-TWO YEARS LATER

Traffic, glass towers, noise.

INT. BANK OFFICE - DAY #5#

ARJUN (28), crisp shirt, loosened tie, stares at a spreadsheet. A PEON sets down a cup of chai.

ARJUN
Not now. Please.

INT. ARJUN'S FLAT - NIGHT #6#

Arjun on the balcony, phone to his ear.

ARJUN
Maa? Yes, I'm eating. I promise.

MAA (V.O.)
(on phone)
You always say that.

EXT. RIVERBANK VILLAGE - DAY (FLASHBACK) #7#

The paper boat again, tipping over in the current. Arjun reaches for it and misses.

INT. BANK OFFICE - DAY #8#

Arjun signs a resignation letter. He folds it into a paper boat.
